# Dates in the JSON output of every backend

```catala
#[test]
declaration scope S:
  output future content date
  output past content date
  output year_zero content date
  output year_minus_one content date
  output year_10000 content date
  output usual content date

scope S:
  definition future equals |2000-01-01| + 100000000 day
  definition past equals |2000-01-01| - 1000000 day
  definition year_zero equals |2000-01-01| - 2000 year
  definition year_minus_one equals |2000-01-01| - 2001 year
  definition year_10000 equals |2000-01-01| + 8000 year
  definition usual equals |2024-02-29|
```
